-    Example (compare the last to example in L{ParserElement.transformString}::
-        hex_ints = OneOrMore(Word(hexnums)).setParseAction(tokenMap(int, 16))
-        hex_ints.runTests('''
-            00 11 22 aa FF 0a 0d 1a
